    "body": "Hold: the Hub kit build found two P0s on main that this post inherits from the shared lathe engine/post contract (Fanuc Lathe has them too): #629 (every thread is cut left-hand) and #630 (nose-centre path posted with G40, so parts come out oversize). They will be fixed in the shared layer, and this post will take the fix before the Hub run. Post-specific findings to fix here: G33's K is recomputed per block from rounded Z (three K values per pass), and G76 is refused on a 1 µm rounding mismatch between the major/minor/height values. The G76 word set will also be checked against PathPilot's own accepted G76 (`R2 Q30 D…`).",
